<title>USA: Advanta boosts qtly divs on Class A and B.</title>
<headline>Advanta boosts qtly divs on Class A and B.</headline>
<dateline>SPRING HOUSE, Pa. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanta Corp said Wednesday that it is raising the quarterly dividend on its class B common stock to $0.132 per share, up from $0.108.</p>
<p>The company also said it is raising the dividend on its class A common stock to $0.11 per share, up from $0.09.</p>
<p>Fourth quarter dividends will be payable December 17 to shareholders of record November 29, the company said.</p>
</text>
